{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1770709147_6252015_3e404fc052bc29b419d5ce4947129a0c.jpg",
  "description": "<p style=\"font-size:16.002px;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif;white-space:normal;margin-top:0px;\"><strong>Essenther: Stylish, Comfortable, and Affordable Everyday Essentials</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.002px;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif;white-space:normal;\">Essenther is a brand dedicated to providing modern women with stylish, comfortable, and budget-friendly everyday wear. Whether you're looking for chic lingerie, functional activewear, or casual outfits, Essenther has got you covered. We believe that fashion shouldn’t come with a luxury price tag—it should be a seamless part of your daily life.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.002px;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif;white-space:normal;\"><strong>1. Lingerie Collection</strong><br>Essenther’s lingerie line focuses on simplicity and comfort, featuring soft, breathable fabrics and body-hugging designs that let you move freely. From seamless basics to elegant lace styles, our bras and panties are perfect for everyday wear while adding a touch of sophistication to your look.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.002px;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif;white-space:normal;\"><strong>2. Activewear Collection</strong><br>Whether you're into yoga, running, or hitting the gym, Essenther’s activewear collection offers the support and style you need. We combine functionality with fashion, using high-performance, moisture-wicking fabrics to keep you dry and confident during workouts. Plus, our sleek designs make it easy to transition from the gym to the streets without missing a beat.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.002px;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif;white-space:normal;\"><strong>3. Casual Wear Collection</strong><br>Essenther’s casual wear is all about bringing ease and style to your everyday life. From cozy loungewear to versatile staples, our pieces are designed to be both practical and trendy. Whether you're relaxing at home or heading out for a casual meetup, Essenther keeps you comfortable and stylish.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.002px;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif;white-space:normal;\"><strong>Why Choose Essenther?</strong></p>\n<ul style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif;font-size:16.002px;white-space:normal;\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"margin:0px;\"><strong>Style Meets Comfort</strong>: We carefully select fabrics and designs to ensure every piece feels as good as it looks.</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0px;\"><strong>Affordable Quality</strong>: We believe high-quality clothing shouldn’t break the bank, and Essenther delivers just that.</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0px;\"><strong>Versatile Options</strong>: From lingerie to activewear to casual wear, Essenther offers a one-stop shop for all your wardrobe needs.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.002px;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif;white-space:normal;\">Explore Essenther’s full collection and discover your everyday style. Whether you’re all about comfort or making a statement, Essenther is here to help you look and feel your best every day.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.002px;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-family:Inter, 'system-ui', '-apple-system', BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Noto Sans', Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', Oxygen, 'Open Sans', sans-serif;white-space:normal;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong>Shop All on Essenther and elevate your everyday style!</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"></p>",
